Cell["\<\
The gl(3) representation are labeled by the eigenvalues of the Cartans of the \
highest weight state:
Rep1= {\[Lambda][1,1],\[Lambda][1,2],\[Lambda][1,3]}
Rep2={\[Lambda][2,1],\[Lambda][2,2],\[Lambda][2,3]}

We have that:
\[Lambda][*,1]\[GreaterEqual]\[Lambda][*,2]\[GreaterEqual]\[Lambda][*,3]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977806948378294*^9, 3.9778069774759293`*^9}, {
  3.977822632870441*^9, 3.9778226833648777`*^9}, {3.979203276682713*^9, 
  3.979203310280034*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"701231cd-207f-4af6-88d0-\
5b4f3b17b682"],

